1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,250
Footprints in the snow led to the farm.

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:03,260
None led away.

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,430
Bavaria, March 1922.

4
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:07,990
A lonely farm called Hinterkaifeck.

5
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:12,370
The farmer, Andreas Gruber, reportedly told neighbours about the tracks.

6
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:14,080
He'd heard footsteps in the attic.

7
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:14,700
He searched.

8
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:15,370
Nobody.

9
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:18,500
A Munich newspaper turned up that nobody had bought.

10
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:20,340
Then a house key went missing.

11
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:22,510
Their previous maid had already quit.

12
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:24,430
She'd heard noises in the attic too.

13
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:27,000
On March thirty-first, the new maid arrived.

14
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:27,950
Her first day.

15
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:30,830
That night, all six people on the farm were killed.

16
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:33,320
No one found them for four days.

17
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:35,290
And that's where it gets stranger.

18
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:38,990
Neighbours later said smoke rose from the chimney in those days.

19
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,060
Someone had been feeding the cattle.

20
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:44,750
Investigators concluded the killer stayed on the farm for days.

21
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:47,610
Police looked at more than a hundred suspects.

22
00:00:47,630 --> 00:00:49,320
Nobody was ever convicted.

23
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:53,910
In 2007, police students re-examined the files with modern methods.

24
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:57,650
They reportedly narrowed it to one main suspect, but never named that

25
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:58,690
person publicly.

26
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:01,120
Officially, the case is still unsolved.

27
00:01:01,550 --> 00:01:02,630
Why would anyone stay?

28
00:01:02,650 --> 00:01:03,710
Tell me what you think.

29
00:01:04,070 --> 00:01:05,700
And it all began in the snow.
